=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Perih Vashai} in {z:Windurst Woods} at (K-7).
** She might mention something unrelated to this quest about Trusts ("If it's a scrrroll you seek, then I bid you talk to {p:Shikaree Z|BGWiki:Trusts}.") the first time you talk to her each time upon zoning in. Just talk to her repeatedly until her dialogue is related instead to this quest.
* Travel to {z:Sauromugue Champaign} and find the cave at (L-10). To get there, go up the cliff at (L-8). Examine the Tiger Bones in the cave to spawn the {m:Old Sabertooth} and watch it die naturally, a process which takes approximately three agonizing earth minutes.
** Easiest way to reach the cave is via the {p:Survival Guide} located at (J-9/J-10).
* Once the Old Sabertooth dies naturally, examine the Tiger Bones to get the {@k} {k:Old tiger's fang}.
** If you fight or otherwise disturb the Old Sabertooth you will not be able to get the key item.
** If you do not click the Tiger Bones in a reasonable amount of time after death, you will have to click on the Tiger Bones and watch it die naturally again.
* Return to Perih Vashai to complete the quest.

